0..77 Comment "//! Two products of one size count the same applications of a free successor."
78..81 Comment "//!"
82..164 Comment "//! Grégoire and Leroy normalise Church numerals, whose normal forms apply a free"
165..245 Comment "//! successor many times. Comparing 256 times 64 with 64 times 256 needs a large"
246..259 Comment "//! readback."
260..263 Comment "//!"
264..341 Comment "//! The iteration applies a free `s` to a free `z` as many times as a product"
342..406 Comment "//! counts. Both endpoints read back as 256 applications of `s`."
407..410 Comment "//!"
411..491 Comment "//! - cites: [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction], § 6"
492..530 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
531..534 Comment "//!"
535..708 Comment "//! [Gregoire-2002-a_compiled_implementation_of_strong_reduction]: https://doi.org/10.1145/581478.581501 \"Grégoire and Leroy, A compiled implementation of strong reduction\""
